least one industry: coding.&nbsp;

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:29.800
But, this has created a new bottleneck.
There's more AI code than ever,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:33.400
which means devs now spend more&nbsp;
time reviewing code than writing it.&nbsp;

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:37.480
And reviewing 30,000 lines of code&nbsp;
by hand isn't realistic either.&nbsp;

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:42.680
